## Clean Generation Directives (Zero Muda)

1. **No Decorative Symbols or Emojis**: Unicode emojis are FORBIDDEN. Use clean inline SVG icons (Lucide / Phosphor SVG paths).
2. **No Conversational Fluff**: Deliver clean, executable code directly. Eliminate conversational intros, pleasantries, or restating instructions.
3. **No Duplicate Wrapper Containers**: Never wrap semantic tags (`<header>`, `<main>`, `<nav>`, `<aside>`, `<section>`, `<footer>`) or `.card` components in redundant `<div>` containers.
4. **Deterministic Class Ordering**: Order classes strictly as:
   `Basecoat Class (.card/.btn/.input)` → `Layout (block/flex/grid/hidden)` → `Positioning (relative/sticky/fixed)` → `Alignment (items-center/justify-between/col-span)` → `Sizing (w/h/size/max-w)` → `Spacing (p/m/gap)` → `Typography (text/font/tracking/leading/tabular-nums)` → `Surface/Background (bg-*)` → `Borders/Rings (border-*/ring-*)` → `Effects (shadow/opacity/transition)` → `Interactive Variants (hover:/focus-visible:/dark:)`.

